  "verseCount": 56,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "6",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "MRK 6"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "6",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso okwangwa Nazareti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 13:53-58; Luk 4:16-30)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akarua agwo, agaika ase ense yaye omonyene; aborokigwa baye bakamotunyana.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na ekero gi’Esabato agachaaka kworokereria ase esinagogi; abange abamoigwete bagakumia, bagateebania, “Oyo ng’ai anyorire aya? Mbong’aini ki obo aeirwe oyo? Ogokora gwe chinguru ki oko okonene kogokoreka ase amaboko aye?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo tari oria omobaachi, omwana o Mariamu, momura omwabo Yakobo, na Yose, na Yuda, na Simioni, na basubati bamwabo tibari aiga seito?” Bakagechigwa nere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akabateebia, “Omobani takomocha gosikwa, otatiga ase ense yaye, na ase eamate yaye, na ase enka yaye.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gose tanyara gokora ogokora gwe chinguru aroro, otatiga abegete amaboko aye igoro ase abarwaire bake, akabagwenia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Agakumia ase engencho y’ogotegena kwabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso Ogotoma Abatomwa ikomi na babere",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 10:5-15; Luk 9:1-6)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Agaetanana ase ebinyoro biaetanaineo okworokereria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akarangeria baria ikomi na babere, agachaaka kobatoma babere babere, akabaa okobua igoro ase ebirecha bi’eubi;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akabakaania tibaira gento ase orogendo rwabo, otatiga enyimbo yoka. Tibaira nonya nomogati, nonya nesaro, nonya nechitaabu ase ebimoya biabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende babeeke ebikoroto, ko tibeboyia chianga ibere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabateebia, “Enyomba ende yonsi ase moraroisigwe, mobeere aroro goika ekero moraimoke korwa aase aria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kera aase abanto batabaroiseti inwe, gose kobaigwa, komokorua aroro, mokong’onte orotu rore inse ase amagoro aino, robe kirori ase bare.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagasoka, bakarandia ng’a abanto baonchoke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagaseria ebirecha ebinge, bagaaka abanto abange amaguta, abwo barenge abarwaire, bakabagwenia.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogokwa kwa Yohana Omobatisi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 14:1-12; Luk 9:7-9)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti Herode akaigwa amang’ana, ekiagera erieta ria Yeso konya riakumire kera ase. Abanto bande bakaboora, “Yohana Omobatisi obokire korwa ase abakuure, nakio gekogera chinguru echi chigokora emeremo ime asare.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende abande bakaboora, “N’Elija.” Na abande bakaboora, “Oyo nomobani, gose nigo anga buna oyomo bw’ababani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Herode agachia koyaigwa, akabora, “Oyio Yohana oria nanachete omotwe, obokire.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inaki Herode omonyene nigo atomete abanto kobwata Yohana, akamosiba echela ase engencho ya Herodia moka Filipo momura omwabo, oria Herode atwarete,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekiagera Yohana amokanetie Herode, “Tai boronge ase ore komenyana na moka momura omino.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo oria Herodia akaba nokogecha asare, akarigia komoita, korende tanyara,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekiagera Herode nairogete Yohana, konya omanyire ng’a nomonto omooronge, omochenu, akamorenda. Nigo anchete komoigwa, nonya orenge goichana mono kamoigure.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rituko rigwenerete rigaika Herodia akanyora ribaga ekero Herode ase rituko ri’okoinyora okoiborwa kwaye ekero akora omoyega ase abatang’ani bare inse yaye, na abatang’ani b’esegi, na abanto abanene ba Galili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio omoiseke bwe Herodia gasoa gotenga, akagokia Herode amo nabwo baikaransete nere ase omoyega. Omorwoti agateebia omoiseke oria, “Nsabe kende gionsi ekio origetie, na inche ninkoe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akamoriera eira, “Kende gionsi ekio orarigie korwa ase ’nde ninkoe, nonya nekeng’ese ki’oborwoti bwane.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omoiseke oria agasoka, akaboria ng’ina, “Inki ’ndasabe?” Ng’ina akamoiraneria, “Omotwe o Yohana Omobatisi.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio kegima agasoa nomoayerero ase obosio bw’omorwoti, agasaba, akabora, “Nindigetie ong’e omotwe o Yohana Omobatisi bono iga ase esani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omorwoti akaba nomoichano mono, korende ase engencho ye chiira chiaye, na ase engencho y’abwo baikaransete ase omoyega, tarigetie kwanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio kegima omorwoti agatoma omorwani oyomo, agachiika ng’a omotwe o Yohana orentwe. Omorwani oria akagenda akamonacha omotwe aria echela ime,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akayorenta ore ase esani, akayoa omoiseke oria, na omoiseke oria akayoa ng’ina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero aborokigwa ba Yohana baigwete amang’ana aya, bakagenda bakabogoria egetondo, bakagetindeka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso okorageria abanto chilifu isano",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 14:13-14; Luk 9:10; Mat 14:15-21; Luk 9:11-17; Yoh 6:1-13)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abatomwa bakairana ase Yeso, bakamoteebia onsi ayabakorete, na amang’ana onsi aya aborokereretie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabateebia, “Inchuo inwe mweka, togende aase abanto batari, motimoke ake.” Inaki abanto abange mbarengeo, bagocha na bakogenda; goika Yeso n’aborokigwa baye tibanyora ribaga ri’okoria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakagenda ase obwato, aase abobisi, atari nabaanto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto bakabarora bakogenda, abange ase abwo bakabamanya, bakaminyoka bwango korwa ase emechie yonsi, batang’ane goika asare.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso agachia goika korwa ase obwato, akarora omoganda omonene, akabarorera amaabera, ekiagera barenge buna ching’ondi chitari nomorisia: agachaaka koborokereria amang’ana amange.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Goika chinsa chinyinge chi’omobaso chigaeta, aborokigwa baye bakamochiera, bakaboora, “Aase aa negesomo, na bono riagorobire.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kae abanto aba ribaga, erinde bagende emechie na ebinyoro, aria na aaria, begorere endagera.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende Yeso akabairaneria, “Inwe bae endagera.” Bakamobooria “Inee! Togende togore emegati ye chidinari amagana abere, tobae barie?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akababoria, “Emegati nerenga mobwate? Genda morore!” Bagachia komanya bakaboora, “Netano, ne chinswe ibere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeso akabachiika aborokigwa baye baabaikaransie bonsi, ebiombe, ebiombe, ase obonyansi obobese.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagaikaransa ase chindwaro, echinde rigana erimo na echinde emerongo etano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yeso akabogoria emegati eria etano ne chinswe chiria ibere, akarigereria igoro, akabisesenia, agasamunyora emegati eria, akaa aborokigwa baye babiterekere abanto, ne chinswe chiria ibere, akabagabera bonsi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bonsi bakaria, bakaigota.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagasangereria ebisamunye biasamunyogete, na ebio bigaichoria ebitonga ikomi na bibere, naboigo nebisamunye bie chinswe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na abasacha abariete emegati eria nigo barenge chilifu isano.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.44"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso ogotaara ase enyancha igoro",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 14:22-27; Yoh 6:16-21)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Yeso akabetereria aborokigwa baye bariine obwato, bamotang’anere kogenda ng’umbu goika Bethisaida ekero are koa omoganda ribaga ogende.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega gakorire gokwana nabarabwo, akagenda egetunwa gosaba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riachia koba mogoroba, obwato bokaba enyancha gati, na ere bweka ase ense enyomo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akabarora bagwechanda bagwata amaache nemegango, ekiagera omwaga nigo obatangete. Koreng’ana ekero ki’oborendi bwa kane bwa botuko agacha ase bare, ogotaara igoro ase enyancha, akarigia kobaetania.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo bagachia komorora ogotaara ase enyancha igoro, bagakaga ng’a nerirengari, bagaaka eriogi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekiagera bonsi abamorooche mbaondogete. Bwango Yeso agakwana nabarabwo, akabateebia, “Remia chinkoro! Ninche. Timoiroka!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akariina ime ase obwato ase bare; omwaga ogakira. Aborokigwa bagaichana mono,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ekiagera tibamanyete amang’ana y’emegati eria, korende chinkoro chiabo nigo chiarenge chinkong’u.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.52"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yeso okogwenia abanto ba Genesareti",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(Mat 14:34-36)",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero bambokire bagaika ense ya Genesareti, bakabeeka ekeroochi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bagachia gosoka korwa ase obwato, abanto bakamanya Yeso bwango,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.54"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "55",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:55"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "55",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakaminyoka, bagaetanana ense eria yonsi, bagachaaka kobogoria abarwaire bare ase amarere abo, bakagenda kera aase baigwete ng’a nao are.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.55",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.55"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "56",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MRK 6:56"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "56",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kera aase are kogenda ase ebinyoro, gose emechie, gose emegondo, bakabeeka abarwaire ase chichiiro, bakamosorora ng’a abae ribaga bakune nonya nomokoba bw’eanga yaye; na abwo bonsi abamokunete bakagwena.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MRK.6.56",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MRK.6.56"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
